  "No starting section in the list; the strategy names the start as This Deal Is Getting Worse, Cloud City Chasm Walkway, Secret Plans, Prepared Defenses, IAO (Imperial Arrest Order), MP (Mobilization Points) and Weather Vane. All are in the posted list and count toward the 60; several Effects start, so no single starting Effect is set.",
